  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• Trim and roughly chop pea pods.\n• In a small bowl, combine Japanese-style dressing, soy sauce mix and the brown sugar.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686495bafa95d35ec97311c9/step-df9dfd00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat, then add Japanese dressing mixture, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686495bafa95d35ec97311c9/step-69dcaf10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine slaw mix, cucumber, pea podsand sesame dressing. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686495bafa95d35ec97311c9/step-a9320720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fill tortillas with sesame cucumber slaw and Japanese-style tofu.\n• Spoon over any remaining sauce from the pan to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686495bafa95d35ec97311c9/step-12f9e130.jpg"
    }
  ]
